1
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:18,349
(Leonard:)What you doing?

2
00:00:18,518 --> 00:00:20,898
Attempting to view work
as a peripheral image...

3
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:24,942
(Sheldon:)...so as to engage
the superior colliculus of my brain.

4
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:31,280
(Penny:)Interesting. I usually just have coffee.

5
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:33,528
(Penny:)-You've been up all night?
-Is it morning?

6
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,950
(Penny:)-Yes.
-Then I've been up all night.

7
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:40,125
(Penny:)And you're stuck?

8
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:44,000
(Sheldon:)Why else would a person try to engage
their superior colliculus?

9
00:00:44,169 --> 00:00:47,959
Uh, sorry, sweetie.
I can't help you till I've had my coffee.

10
00:00:55,388 --> 00:01:03,018
(Leonard:)If you don't put him in his crate at night,
he just runs around the apartment.

